# ASUS ExpertBook Ultra (B9406CAA) PixArt I2C-HID haptic touchpad (093A:4F05)
# The pad's HID report descriptor gives Tip Pressure no Logical Maximum of its
# own, so the kernel reports the Y field's 2601 as the pressure maximum and
# libinput's pressure heuristics reject every touch as a jump. Clamping to 100
# is a known-working empirical value; the libinput quirk alone is sufficient.
evdev:input:b0018v093Ap4F05*
 EVDEV_ABS_18=0:100:0:0
 EVDEV_ABS_3A=0:100:0:0
